---
import SectionHeading from '../../components/SectionHeading.astro';
---
<section class="section" data-theme="white" aria-labelledby="positioning-title">
  <div class="container home-split">
    <SectionHeading id="positioning-title" eyebrow="The integrated perspective" title="Financial Clarity. Operational Discipline. Strategic Execution." />
    <div class="stack home-positioning-copy">
      <p class="home-lead">We help serious operators ensure their strategy actually produces profit.</p>
      <p>Financial performance and operational execution cannot be managed independently. Decisions about pricing, working capital, capacity, and cost shape one another.</p>
      <p>The Ramaekers Group connects strategy, financial decisions, and daily operations so leadership priorities translate into measurable business results.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
